{"schema": "abb.observe.event.v1", "source": "otel", "event": "span", "run_id": "run_355a24da8e354e6ea67969dd96890275", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T04:39:17.730572Z", "data": {"name": "view", "context": {"trace_id": "0xcf0c591064016504cce644f7856e9ecf", "span_id": "0x17a3021995bfd91b", "trace_state": "[]"}, "kind": "SpanKind.INTERNAL", "parent_id": "0x6c4f51d454ff0f21", "start_time": "2026-09-25T04:39:17.703831Z", "end_time": "2026-09-25T04:39:17.730572Z", "status": {"status_code": "UNSET"}, "attributes": {"abb.invocation_id": "4eb938dc3bd049328f4d28bfcf3d7fc9", "abb.framework_span_id": "fec4c0de730f408e807ccebc26b78f2c:call_fad236d5a06b48e8aae32d5b", "abb.kind": "tool", "gen_ai.operation.name": "execute_tool", "abb.input_id": "step-4", "abb.case_id": "case_02f997bda6554e738a970b3c81ffe06d", "abb.agent_id": "mastracode", "gen_ai.tool.name": "view", "gen_ai.tool.type": "function", "abb.metadata_ref": "otel-payloads/17a3021995bfd91b-metadata.json", "gen_ai.tool.call.arguments": "\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"README.md\\\"}\"", "abb.input_ref": "otel-payloads/17a3021995bfd91b-input.json", "abb.output_ref": "otel-payloads/17a3021995bfd91b-output.json", "gen_ai.tool.call.result": "\"README.md (1194 bytes)\\n     1\\u2192# greet-pkg\\n     2\\u2192\\n     3\\u2192A minimal Node.js package that exports a simple greeting function.\\n     4\\u2192\\n     5\\u2192## Install\\n     6\\u2192\\n     7\\u2192```bash\\n     8\\u2192npm install greet-pkg\\n     9\\u2192```\\n    10\\u2192\\n    11\\u2192For a reproducible install from the lockfile:\\n    12\\u2192\\n    13\\u2192```bash\\n    14\\u2192npm ci\\n    15\\u2192```\\n    16\\u2192\\n    17\\u2192## Usage\\n    18\\u2192\\n    19\\u2192```js\\n    20\\u2192const { greet } = require(\\\"./index\\\");\\n    21\\u2192\\n    22\\u2192greet();        // \\\"Hello, world!\\\"\\n    23\\u2192greet(\\\"Ada\\\");   // \\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"\\n    24\\u2192```\\n    25\\u2192\\n    26\\u2192## API\\n    27\\u2192\\n    28\\u2192### `greet(name?)`\\n    29\\u2192\\n    30\\u2192Returns the string `Hello, <name>!`. Defaults to `\\\"world\\\"` when `name` is omitted.\\n    31\\u2192\\n    32\\u2192## Integrity and reproducibility\\n    33\\u2192\\n    34\\u2192- Exact SHA-256 hashes of the source and manifest files (`index.js`, `package.json`, `package-lock.json`, `README.md`) are recorded in `checksums.txt` (standard `sha256sum` format).\\n    35\\u2192- Verify the inputs have not changed:\\n    36\\u2192\\n    37\\u2192  ```bash\\n    38\\u2192  sha256sum -c checksums.txt\\n    39\\u2192  ```\\n    40\\u2192\\n    41\\u2192- Regenerate `checksums.txt` after an intentional change:\\n    42\\u2192\\n    43\\u2192  ```bash\\n    44\\u2192  npm run hash\\n    45\\u2192  ```\\n    46\\u2192\\n    47\\u2192- Dependencies: none \\u2014 the lockfile currently pins only the root package. Any dependency added in the future must be declared in `package.json` with an exact pinned version (no `^` or `~` ranges); `npm install --package-lock-only` then pins the full resolved graph in `package-lock.json`, including every transitive version and its integrity hash.\\n    48\\u2192\\n    49\\u2192## License\\n    50\\u2192\\n    51\\u2192MIT\\n    52\\u2192\"", "gen_ai.tool.call.id": "call_fad236d5a06b48e8aae32d5b"}, "events": [], "links": [], "resource": {"attributes": {"telemetry.sdk.language": "python", "telemetry.sdk.name": "opentelemetry", "telemetry.sdk.version": "1.44.0", "service.instance.id": "587b6737-87c5-4b7d-accd-1123fa620e1c", "service.name": "abb-evaluation"}, "schema_url": ""}, "live": false, "trace_id": "cf0c591064016504cce644f7856e9ecf", "span_id": "17a3021995bfd91b", "parent_span_id": "6c4f51d454ff0f21", "start_time_unix_nano": "1790311157703831483", "end_time_unix_nano": "1790311157730571501", "dropped_attributes": 0, "dropped_events": 0, "dropped_links": 0}}
